Create and list internal teams through the platform API.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime team [command]

Available Commands:
  create      Create a team and managed namespace
  init        Deprecated: use team create instead
  list        List teams
  user        Manage password-login users for a team

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for team

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime team [command] --help" for more information about a command.
